__pycache__/
*.pyc
tests/
.venv*/

# The dated acquisition and everything cut from it: 321 MB that the image never reads.
# `twin/raw` is the immutable DDA snapshot and `twin/out` its derivatives; the loader mounts
# both from the host at run time precisely so no backend image carries a copy of one day's Dubai.
# Without these two lines every cold build sends all of it to the daemon before doing anything.
twin/raw/
twin/out/
